Spec: Website Verification

Purpose:
  Prevent regressions in menu integrity, accessibility, production security and indexing.

Owns:
  ./contracts.test.mjs
  ./browser/site.spec.mjs

Must:
  Browser checks run against the production build with its security response headers applied.
  Checks cover keyboard focus, image failures, text alternatives and automated WCAG rules at mobile and desktop widths.
  Source-preservation tests compare every dish and price with the archived transcription.
  Indexing tests distinguish production from preview and unconfigured origins.
